{"uuid": "38e6f465-7371-4ca0-84b5-3a4b5c6d7e8f", "cwd": "/tmp/agent-ide-demo/git/dataflow-docs", "gitBranch": "docs/lineage", "sessionId": "4cc9c6cb-e2e5-4c3c-87e9-90a1d01fde20", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T17:36:12.000Z", "type": "assistant", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rewrote `docs/lineage.md`:\n\n- the one-line chain is now `orders + customers -> revenue_daily`, which is what the models do\n- a **mermaid** diagram from the two sources to the mart\n- a note that `orders` is incremental and `customers` is rebuilt\n\nTo check the mart against the diagram:\n\n```sql\nselect o.order_id, c.customer_id, r.day\nfrom {{ ref('orders') }} o\njoin {{ ref('customers') }} c using (customer_id)\njoin {{ ref('revenue_daily') }} r on r.day = o.updated_at::date\nlimit 10\n```"}], "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "usage": {"input_tokens": 3, "cache_read_input_tokens": 36800, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1197, "output_tokens": 400}}}
